#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:3
#: a6037decc5164b56b11ce6e17e13fd33
msgid "原子层分组（Layer Groups）"
msgstr "Layer Groups"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:5
#: fa25eeaae2e644158abdc000f411c3e9
msgid "**分类：** 结构"
msgstr "**Category:** Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:7
#: f32be4702087474c9dbb8e8b07546055
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:9
#: 428756d258184be4bbb889595c57d0d6
msgid ""
"沿所选 `(hkl)` 晶面法向识别原子层，再把相邻层依次标为 `A、B、A、B…`。 每个输入固定得到一个输出；元素、坐标、晶胞和周期边界不变，只新增或更新逐原子数组 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`。"
msgstr ""
"Identify atomic layers along the normal of the selected `(hkl)` plane, then label "
"adjacent layers in sequence as `A, B, A, B, …`. Each input produces exactly one "
"output. Elements, coordinates, the cell, and periodic boundaries remain unchanged; "
"only the per-atom array `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` is added or updated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:13
#: 0673c638605e41ce93ccd7a9a51dc76b
msgid ""
"这些标签可供磁序、定向空位或其他读取 `group` 的下游卡片选择原子。它不是结构筛选， 也不会改变元素。`Config_type` 中的 `Grp(...)` "
"只记录操作来源，不能替代逐原子 `group` 数组。"
msgstr ""
"These labels let downstream cards such as Magnetic Order and oriented-vacancy "
"operations select atoms through `group`. The card neither filters structures nor "
"changes elements. `Grp(...)` in `Config_type` records provenance only; it does not "
"replace the per-atom `group` array."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:16
#: 9c3e42d4b6d442d18eeff1aa2f226471
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:18
#: b19bf747602146729d37dff43a3c97fe
msgid "设 ASE 晶胞的三条晶格矢量组成矩阵 $\\mathbf A$，Miller 指数为 $\\mathbf h=(h,k,l)^\\mathsf T$。程序使用倒空间法向"
msgstr ""
"Let the three lattice vectors of the ASE cell form the matrix $\\mathbf A$, and let "
"the Miller index be $\\mathbf h=(h,k,l)^\\mathsf T$. The program uses the reciprocal-"
"space normal"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:21
#: b7d414d331c84be5ab515953a328ed8a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf g=\\mathbf A^{-1}\\mathbf h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf n}=\\frac{\\mathbf g}{\\lVert\\mathbf g\\rVert},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:27
#: 27633defb1b74d2e8cb9d4caf695fd86
msgid "并按原子在该法向上的投影距离"
msgstr "and sorts atoms by their projected distance along this normal:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:29
#: bd23798c372f4c698382773da243801f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"u_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}\n"
"   =\\frac{\\mathbf s_i\\cdot\\mathbf h}{\\lVert\\mathbf g\\rVert}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:34
#: 2ba2026c495d4915ae0a5ed1fb3f2581
msgid ""
"排序。这里 $\\mathbf r_i$ 和 $\\mathbf s_i$ 分别是笛卡尔坐标和分数坐标。因此 `(100)` 表示晶面指数，不等同于笛卡尔 X "
"方向；非正交晶胞仍使用真实倒空间法向。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\mathbf r_i$ and $\\mathbf s_i$ are the Cartesian and fractional coordinates, "
"respectively. Therefore, `(100)` denotes a crystallographic plane index rather than "
"the Cartesian X direction; a non-orthogonal cell still uses its true reciprocal-space"
" normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:37
#: 1f76b5976dcc4c75bf5bef8974b203b4
msgid ""
"投影区间宽度不超过 `layer_tolerance` 的原子归入同一层。若法向包含周期方向，程序会 按周期相位处理，并把晶胞两端在容差内的同一层合并。第 "
"$\\ell_i$ 层的标签为"
msgstr ""
"Atoms whose projection interval is no wider than `layer_tolerance` are assigned to "
"the same layer. If the normal includes a periodic direction, the program works in "
"periodic phase and merges a layer split across the two cell boundaries when it lies "
"within the tolerance. The label of layer $\\ell_i$ is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:40
#: e377011de71c4dfcbb16cbf6550c0cbe
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\operatorname{group}(i)=\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"\\text{group\\_a}, & \\ell_i\\bmod 2=0,\\\\\n"
"\\text{group\\_b}, & \\ell_i\\bmod 2=1.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:48
#: b55000fd7a614b9f9121cb9d52669fe6
msgid "输出数量始终为"
msgstr "The output count is always"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:50
#: 3af54c6c46664f5d9a69cbd66b8c586c
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:54
#: 46518d20bf8a45699104ae6673418aa2
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:56
#: 1c171068f7894638ba601e8b1a1a7fd8
msgid ""
"例如 `(100)` 方向检测到四层、各有两个原子时，预览显示 `A(2) → B(2) → A(2) → B(2)`。运行后八个原子的 `group` 数组依次为 "
"`A, A, B, B, A, A, B, B`，结构本身保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"For example, if four layers with two atoms each are detected along `(100)`, the "
"preview shows `A(2) → B(2) → A(2) → B(2)`. After the operation, the eight entries in "
"the `group` array are `A, A, B, B, A, A, B, B`, while the structure itself remains "
"unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:60
#: d0c4680ffed542418b751fc3db054cf2
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:62
#: cae53f802c204b6ca0e63072df9100b4
msgid "晶面指数（miller_index）"
msgstr "Miller Index (miller_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:64
#: ea707911087e4041ae9886712a48a288
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `001`。可选 `100`、`010`、`001`、`110`、`111`。`(001)` "
"在常见立方和四方常规晶胞中通常能直接形成可检查的交替层；选择的是晶面法向， 不是笛卡尔坐标轴。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `001`. Available choices are `100`, `010`, `001`, `110`, and `111`. In"
" common conventional cubic and tetragonal cells, `(001)` usually gives an alternating"
" layer sequence that is easy to inspect. The selection is a plane normal, not a "
"Cartesian axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:67
#: 27c3bed377a3468abb6946cb1f38923f
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layer Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:69
#: f59eb73b1fe5450fbb27e66c886e0517
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05 Å`。同层原子因热扰动产生轻微起伏时可适当增大；相邻层被误合并时 应减小。容差必须为正数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.05 Å`. Increase it moderately when thermal displacement gives "
"atoms in one layer a slight corrugation; decrease it if adjacent layers are merged "
"incorrectly. The tolerance must be positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:72
#: bc916a467f044494bea8db7f11541a1a
msgid "A 组标签（group_a）"
msgstr "group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:74
#: a1243b3549e34b29ab3d2f2bf446d4e1
msgid "`str`，默认 `A`。写入第 0、2、4…层，不能为空。"
msgstr "`str`, default `A`. Written to layers 0, 2, 4, and so on. It cannot be empty."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:76
#: 2d9d47121fd04b588996fb1fbad6a6ea
msgid "B 组标签（group_b）"
msgstr "group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:78
#: 8458454f78e4459495f1ad5fd584612b
msgid "`str`，默认 `B`。写入第 1、3、5…层，不能为空且不能与 `group_a` 相同。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `B`. Written to layers 1, 3, 5, and so on. It cannot be empty or equal"
" to `group_a`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:80
#: 46858c6033574fc0918cc622042bc844
msgid "覆盖已有分组（overwrite）"
msgstr "overwrite"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:82
#: ef76ff70a03849bc95516c61d089cef8
msgid "`bool`，默认关闭。输入已经包含 `group` 时，关闭会原样保留现有标签；开启才按当前晶面 和容差重新分组。界面会显示首个输入的现有计数或新的层序预览。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, disabled by default. If an input already contains `group`, leaving this off "
"preserves the existing labels unchanged; enable it to regroup using the current plane"
" and tolerance. The interface shows either the existing counts from the first input "
"or a preview of the new layer sequence."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:85
#: 116ca6caafc04a20ad3262076245c125
msgid "使用与检查"
msgstr "Usage and Checks"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:87
#: d51eb11125fd4284b0f3b19afc70cf68
msgid "选择晶面并查看首个输入的层序与各组原子数。"
msgstr ""
"Select a plane and inspect the layer sequence and atom count of each group for the "
"first input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:88
#: e6d5e8d5a6a04e50b4854f7dd6f9fc8b
msgid "若只检测到一层，扩胞、换晶面或减小容差；卡片不会把单层结果伪装成有效 A/B 分组。"
msgstr ""
"If only one layer is detected, build a supercell, choose another plane, or reduce the"
" tolerance. The card does not present a single-layer result as a valid A/B grouping."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:89
#: 68dee1a0d013486283fd6784730b36a6
msgid "若周期方向上是奇数层，普通原子选择仍可使用；周期 A/B 磁序会在边界出现同组相接。"
msgstr ""
"With an odd number of layers along a periodic direction, ordinary atom selection "
"still works, but a periodic A/B magnetic order will place identical groups next to "
"each other across the boundary."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:90
#: c8a6d500077f493fb6140c2f38d215aa
msgid "运行后确认输出文件仍包含逐原子 `group` 数组。EXTXYZ 可以保存字符串分组，但转换到 其他格式时需确认该格式不会丢弃自定义逐原子数组。"
msgstr ""
"After running, confirm that the output file still contains the per-atom `group` "
"array. EXTXYZ can preserve string-valued groups, but when converting to another "
"format, verify that it does not discard custom per-atom arrays."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:93
#: a1bbe3602d84470fa9040b76fae56f5f
msgid "典型磁序流程："
msgstr "Typical magnetic-order workflow:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:95
#: 719059fd23504fe9852166ba248dc1a3
msgid "Super Cell → Layer Groups → Magnetic Order\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:99
#: 9703d537bf934b41864db8309feb4249
msgid "新建或覆盖标签时，`Config_type` 会追加类似："
msgstr ""
"When labels are created or overwritten, an entry similar to the following is appended"
" to `Config_type`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:101
#: 0fdb3cf30d0a48839cf33cb19e8de485
msgid "Grp(hkl111,tol=0.05,A/B)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:105
#: dc14fecf3f034bf5bc879af0661e5b4f
msgid "旧版卡片曾使用晶胞相位二分或半网格奇偶规则。载入含 `mode` 或 `kvec` 的旧配置时， 程序会映射可保留的参数并显示迁移提示；重新运行前应核对新的真实层序预览。"
msgstr ""
"Earlier versions of this card used cell-phase bisection or half-grid parity rules. "
"When loading an old configuration containing `mode` or `kvec`, the program maps "
"parameters that can be retained and displays a migration notice. Check the new "
"physical layer-sequence preview before running it again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:108
#: 62dfc3a1633f4766a701b6098bd18f57
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:110
#: 751c78cc05c44699adfda317ea27d7c7
msgid "**为什么运行前提示只有一层？** 当前晶面方向上没有足够的独立原子层，或容差过大。 按界面建议扩胞、换晶面或减小容差。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the preview report only one layer?** There are not enough distinct atomic "
"layers along the selected plane normal, or the tolerance is too large. Follow the "
"interface suggestion to build a supercell, choose another plane, or reduce the "
"tolerance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:113
#: cdf86753877942e1a264fc60044f84cd
msgid "**为什么参数改变后仍保留旧标签？** 输入已有 `group`，且“覆盖已有分组”处于关闭状态。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the old labels retained after changing parameters?** The input already "
"contains `group`, and `Overwrite existing groups` is disabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "为结构中每个原子写入 `atoms.arrays['group']` 标签（A 或 B），按 "
#~ "k-vector 层分组或分数坐标奇偶分组。这些标签供下游 `Magnetic Order`（AFM group"
#~ " A/B 模式）、`Random Vacancy`、`Random Doping` 的 group"
#~ " 约束使用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Write an A/B label for every atom in "
#~ "`atoms.arrays['group']` using k-vector layers or "
#~ "fractional-coordinate parity. Downstream `Magnetic "
#~ "Order` (AFM group mode), `Random Vacancy`, and"
#~ " `Random Doping` can use these labels as"
#~ " region or sublattice constraints."

#~ msgid "**这是一张元数据卡，不改坐标也不改元素，只写 group 标签。**"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**This is a metadata card. It changes "
#~ "neither coordinates nor species; it only "
#~ "writes group labels.**"

#~ msgid "场景：k-vector AFM 无法匹配你的晶格，模型 AFM 能量系统性偏高"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: A k-vector AFM pattern does not match the lattice"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 NiO 上用 `Magnetic Order` 的 k-vector "
#~ "111 模式生成了 AFM 结构。训练后模型对 AFM 构型的能量预测仍比 DFT "
#~ "高 0.3 eV/atom——k-vector 的波节面穿过了两种不等价原子位，导致 Ni 和 "
#~ "O 都被混合分配正负号，没有形成\"一层 Ni↑、一层 Ni↓\"的清晰子晶格翻转。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "In NiO, a k-vector 111 AFM assignment "
#~ "crosses inequivalent sites and mixes signs "
#~ "across Ni and O rather than producing "
#~ "the intended alternating Ni layers. The "
#~ "resulting AFM training definition does not "
#~ "match the physical sublattices."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** k-vector 是晶体学均匀的翻转模式，适合简单 Bravais "
#~ "晶格。但实际磁性材料常有不等价子晶格——你需要手动定义哪些原子属于 A 子晶格（正磁矩）、哪些属于 B（负磁矩）。`Group"
#~ " Label` 就是做这件事的：先在结构里写好 group 标签，下游 `Magnetic "
#~ "Order` 再用 group A/B 模式按标签翻转磁矩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** A k-vector gives a "
#~ "crystallographically uniform modulation and is "
#~ "natural for a simple Bravais lattice. With "
#~ "inequivalent sublattices, define membership explicitly:"
#~ " label A and B first, then let "
#~ "`Magnetic Order` assign signs by group."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 NiO 超胞，Ni 和 O 交替排列在 fcc 子晶格上"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A NiO supercell with alternating Ni and O fcc sublattices."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 按 k-vec 111 分组，奇数层 = A，偶数层 = B"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Label alternating k-vector 111 layers as A and B."

#~ msgid "`Overwrite` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Overwrite`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 结构不变，但每个原子现在有 `group` = `A` 或 `B`，带 `Grp(k111,A/B)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Unchanged geometry with per-atom "
#~ "`group` A or B and structure label "
#~ "`Grp(k111,A/B)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证分组正确：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify the grouping:**"

#~ msgid "打开输出的 extxyz 文件，检查 `group` 列是否出现 A/B 交替"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Open the extxyz output and inspect the "
#~ "`group` column for the intended A/B sequence."

#~ msgid "对于 (111) 方向，相邻原子层应交替 A/B"
#~ msgstr "For a (111) layer pattern, adjacent layers should alternate A and B."

#~ msgid "用 `Magnetic Order` 的 group A/B 模式接在后面，确认 AFM 输出磁矩有正有负"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Follow with group-mode `Magnetic Order` and"
#~ " confirm the AFM moments contain both signs"
#~ " on the intended sites."

#~ msgid "如果分组几乎全是 A，换 kvec = `110` 或 `100` 验证"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If nearly every atom is A, inspect the"
#~ " orientation and test whether 110 or 100"
#~ " matches the actual layering."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "下游有 `Magnetic Order` 的 AFM group A/B 模式"
#~ msgstr "Downstream AFM assignment uses explicit A/B groups"

#~ msgid "下游 `Random Doping` / `Random Vacancy` 需要对特定区域操作（group 约束）"
#~ msgstr "Doping or vacancy rules must target a sublattice or region"

#~ msgid "需要在结构中定义可复用的子晶格/区域标识"
#~ msgstr "A reusable per-atom sublattice or region identifier is needed"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "全流程不依赖 group 过滤"
#~ msgstr "No downstream operation uses groups"

#~ msgid "下游磁序只用 k-vector 模式（不需要 group 标签）"
#~ msgstr "The magnetic pattern is fully represented by downstream k-vector mode"

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `k-vector layers (recommended)`。按 k-vector 分层还是按分数坐标奇偶写 group 标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `k-vector layers (recommended)`. "
#~ "Choose k-vector layers or fractional-coordinate "
#~ "parity."

#~ msgid "层状磁序，沿 k 方向交替翻转"
#~ msgstr "Layered order alternating along k"

#~ msgid "NaCl 型子晶格交替，不依赖层方向"
#~ msgstr "NaCl-like parity sublattices independent of a selected layer direction"

#~ msgid "k-vector 模式最常用，也是推荐的首选。"
#~ msgstr "Start with k-vector mode for a layered magnetic pattern."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `111`，仅 k-vector 模式。可选 `100`/`010`/`001`/`110`/`111`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `111`; k-vector mode only. One"
#~ " of `100`, `010`, `001`, `110`, or `111`."

#~ msgid "`111`：体对角线方向分层，适合 fcc/bcc 基的 AFM（如 NiO 型）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`111`: layers along a body diagonal, useful"
#~ " for compatible fcc/bcc-derived AFM patterns"

#~ msgid "`100`/`010`/`001`：沿单轴方向分层"
#~ msgstr "`100`/`010`/`001`: layers along one cell direction"

#~ msgid "`110`：面对角线方向"
#~ msgstr "`110`: layers along a face diagonal"

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `A`。可自定义为 `S1`、`up` 等，但必须与下游引用的名称完全一致（区分大小写）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `A`. May be renamed to "
